Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, welcome to Figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We make humanoid robots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We design them, we build them, we test them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:07.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here, this is a secret room that nobody's allowed to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you every robot we've ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, here we lost like a left knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:14.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you can see the robot's kind of like hobbling on the left leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have a robot doing burpees here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where we manufacture figure 3 robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:25.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this was the first car in the world built by a humanoid robot that we're aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a robot here that is designed to tidy the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:33.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,These robots are running purely autonomously from a onboard AI policy called Helix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:34.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give it a push.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:50.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.56,0:00:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, welcome to Figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So where are we right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:00:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:00:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a robot campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robot campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:02.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robot campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We make robots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.24,0:01:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We make humanoid robots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We design them and we build them and we test them all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:16.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So for people who don't know what a humanoid robot you will see in a second cuz this is kind of freaky, but can you explain what they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:17.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um our goal is to build advanced AI that we can put into a general purpose uh humanoid body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, a humanoid is basically just like a robot with a human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have uh arms, hands, head, feet, legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can basically do everything a human can in the world with one piece of hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, so um yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,our goal is to be able to go out and basically design and ship humanoid robots in the world that can do everything from housework to dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:52.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,laundry, uh to manufacturing, healthcare, just basically as much things in the world as possible that we can go out and ship robots to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, we see this on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's our uh that's our This is your hype machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:01:59.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:01:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:04.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh that's our latest generation robot figure three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doing a little like uh concier's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:07.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:07.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what are we going to see today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:11.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to show you some of my robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I think first here is we have uh we have some robots that we basically have constantly running uh around the office 247 talking to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:27.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh greeting people just uh you know basically doing useful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:34.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um these robots uh basically can run fully autonomously without any humans and they can automatically dock themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:39.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,and charge and then um once they're fully charged basically come off and be able to do useful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,So these robots that are docking here um are charging through the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we have a wireless charging stand like similar how you would charge a phone like inductively.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh the robots can charge to their feet at two kilowatts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So basically like um the the battery lasts about um about four to five hours and we can charge basically for an hour and go back and do work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the robots we don't need to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't need to plug them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh they can basically autocharge themselves and just do 247 operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is the role for this one right here just for the docking exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do these ones roam around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,These ones roam around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:12.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:13.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're just docking here just to charge and then they'll be out doing doing useful work all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I saw these ones as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is one of these special?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the So this robot right here, the one uh the American flag was actually at the White House last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We got a call uh asking to be basically the first humanoid group uh basically ever uh to put robots in the White House.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh so last week we basically had the you know first robots in humanoid robots in history there uh doing stuff talking greeting folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we were basically at a very special event with the first lady and um it it went really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:58.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is our uh corporate headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have uh four buildings on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh so here we do uh a lot of basically engineering design work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many people work out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have about 500 a little over 500 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many are in the total company?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um five Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's about there's about 250 300 people here and we have 500 in the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would say most all of it's engineering and then we've been growing out manufacturing uh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,supply chain some of the areas to basically how do we make more robots pretty aggressively.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how many robots do you have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,A few hundred right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:38.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are they outpacing the humans or uh there's slow my my goal for the for this building is I want more robots humanoid robots than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:38.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, walking around and they don't necessarily need to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,They could be sitting or talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, basically we have uh we basically do a lot of uh basically hardware and software validation testing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:05:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, so like testing for burn-in uh durability um bas basically like uh any new software hardware gets validated through this through this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh so you have robots doing all kinds of crazy stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is that is definitely some yoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:13.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robot getting on the ground and getting back up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we're basically trying to stress test the robots to try to any trying to find any potential failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:19.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before like any new hardware software could get released.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if we have a new camera um uh new type of like uh say structure or anything else, we'll we'll test it here before it goes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many potential body movements can they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:33.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is kind of a crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the the robot's basically made up of about 40 like motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:39.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every motor can spin like 360 degrees like all the way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the the mathematically like how many states it could be in like body positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is 360 to the power of 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh more body positions than atoms in the universe, which is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Potentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:05:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've done the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've done the math?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:05:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, so we uh, so it's basically like the the difficulty here is like how do you control it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't write code to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, so all of our robots here run on a neural network we call Helix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's um,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:15.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a vision language action model we designed here internally to to tell the robot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,what to go do to stay balanced like how to move its joints basically uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,from pixels from from camera space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that team that works on Helix is in the same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're in the same building right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're uh, they're phenomenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We basically have a large scale data collection efforts that's going on and then we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,train our own models here internally and then we test them all all here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh that's it's not just like um it's not just like for like for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,balancing and being able to have stability which we need to have like humanlike stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's for how do we um how do we know what to go do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:49.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do we take in prompts from humans and say um like vision from the cameras and how do we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,output every single joint including where the body's positioned and feet and hands to do stuff like it could be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,folding laundry doing manufacturing and logistics that you'll see here later today and we have to do that like a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,few hundred times a second from camera images and uh on a neural network that runs on board the robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's um it's a really hard project.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, so yeah, all the bays here are running some sort of test uh for for durability or reliability testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, why do some have different suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, we are we outfit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have uh all the outfits are uh fabric like a human like clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they all have different clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um which is cool because we can like um you can accessorize the robots the how you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:39.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, our clients can have different like outfits that show like the client logos and the colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:39.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a new level of merch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a new level of merch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:48.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, it's also nice because if like things get dirty or they rip or whatever, we can basically easily replace it without a technician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:49.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the robots have a little zipper on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:52.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can basically just unzip it and basically take it off and put something new on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:56.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also, it's just really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:07:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their shoes look like real sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're high tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:02.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're high tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're hightop sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:08.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and uh yeah, they look they don't they look awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean they look like human bodies.
