Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they're in people's homes, will that data still be trained and will it stay local or will it be spread throughout the network?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.28,0:31:33.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
