Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.87,0:56:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to show you every robot we've ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:33.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.52,0:56:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.35,0:56:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um so we started in 2022 and uh the goal was like how do we get humanoid robots to our AI and software team as fast as possible.
